## 3. Borrow flow
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant L as Librarian
  participant UI as borrow.php
  participant API as api.php
  participant DB as Database
  L->>UI: Scan student QR (STU:no)
  UI->>API: action=student
  API->>DB: find student, count active loans
  API-->>UI: student + active loans
  L->>UI: Scan book QR (BK:accession)
  UI->>API: action=borrow
  API->>DB: BEGIN, check limit and availability, INSERT borrowings, available-1, COMMIT
  API-->>UI: success + due date
```

## 4. Book-request states
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: student requests
  pending --> approved: admin approves (copy held)
  pending --> declined: admin declines
  pending --> cancelled: student cancels
  approved --> fulfilled: student borrows via QR
  approved --> cancelled: student cancels
```

## 5. Login / recovery
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Login] -->|valid| B{role}
  B -->|student| S[student.php]
  B -->|staff| I[index.php]
  A -->|too many failures| L[Temporary lock]
  F[Forgot password] --> R[Admin verifies identity, generates 6-digit code]
  R --> E[User enters code + new password within 10 min]
```
